WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.335
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:03.836
This is "Late Night."
We hope we're doing well.

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.838
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:09.943
The Supreme Court ruled today
that the EPA does not have

00:00:09.943 --> 00:00:12.378
the authority
to set emission standards

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:14.013
for existing power plants.

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:16.816
But they are gonna let you
use the smoke

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:18.952
for gender reveals.

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:21.287
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:24.023
Today was the final day of the
Supreme Court's current term,

00:00:24.023 --> 00:00:25.491
and I got to say, thank God.

00:00:25.491 --> 00:00:29.829
This must be how the Jets feel
when halftime finally arrives.

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:31.997
"Hey, well, we get 15 minutes

00:00:31.997 --> 00:00:34.834
where they can't
kick our asses."

00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:37.336
Wyoming Representative
Liz Cheney spoke yesterday

00:00:37.336 --> 00:00:40.507
at the Ronald Reagan
Presidential Library and Museum

00:00:40.507 --> 00:00:42.542
to discuss the future
of the Republican Party.

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.277
Well, I hate to break it to you,

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.112
but the future
of the Republican Party

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:47.447
isn't at a library.

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:48.981
If anything,
you should have held it

00:00:48.981 --> 00:00:51.317
in the comments section
of 4chan.

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:52.585
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:55.088
Ketanji Brown Jackson
was sworn in today

00:00:55.088 --> 00:00:58.091
as the Supreme Court's
116th justice,

00:00:58.091 --> 00:01:01.895
and then Clarence Thomas
dissented against that, too.

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:03.562
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.562 --> 00:01:05.098
Following
the Supreme Court's decision

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:08.334
to overturn Roe vs. Wade,
urologists have reportedly

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:11.337
seen an uptick
in requests for vasectomies --

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:12.639
and this is weird --

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:14.173
from women.

00:01:14.173 --> 00:01:15.341
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.341 --> 00:01:17.677
"His name is Dave.
I'll bring him in."

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:18.845
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:20.946
Senator Bernie Sanders
sent a letter

00:01:20.946 --> 00:01:23.716
to Transportation Secretary
Pete Buttigieg this week,

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:26.385
calling on the department
to take immediate action

00:01:26.385 --> 00:01:28.188
on issues with air travel,

00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:30.690
specifically those fun
safety videos.

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.592
[ As Sanders ] Just tell us
where the exits are

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:34.427
and shut up.

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:35.762
We don't need a funny video.

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:37.630
No rapping.

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:39.132
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.132 --> 00:01:40.466
[ Normal voice ]
Animal Control officers

00:01:40.466 --> 00:01:41.835
in Nebraska recently removed

00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:43.669
a Miller Lite can that was stuck

00:01:43.669 --> 00:01:44.937
on the head of a skunk.

00:01:44.937 --> 00:01:47.606
God, that smell was awful,

00:01:47.606 --> 00:01:49.275
said the skunk.

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:51.277
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:52.812
And finally, a man in Idaho

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:54.347
recently broke
a Guinness World Record

00:01:54.347 --> 00:01:56.483
by walking nearly 3 1/2 miles

00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:58.618
with a guitar
balanced on his chin.

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.353
The bad news -- he's walking

00:02:00.353 --> 00:02:02.021
to your party.

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:03.189
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:05.058
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

